Changes
-------

Paths below are the paths in the upstream repositories. Each package of the
copy keeps the layout of its upstream package.

2026-10-17: every Python file in `marker/`, `surya/`, and `pdftext/` that
imports another module of these three packages. The change rewrites the
import path from `marker.`, `surya.`, and `pdftext.` to `raw2md_engine.marker.`,
`raw2md_engine.surya.`, and `raw2md_engine.pdftext.`. The change also
rewrites the one module path that `marker/config/parser.py` holds in a
string. No other line changed.

2026-10-18: `marker/processors/llm/`, `marker/services/`,
`marker/extractors/`, `marker/scripts/`, `marker/converters/extraction.py`,
and `marker/renderers/extraction.py` removed. These parts serve the LLM
pass, the extraction converter, and the command-line applications, and
raw2md does not call them.

2026-10-18: `marker/converters/__init__.py`, `marker/converters/pdf.py`,
`marker/converters/table.py`, `marker/config/crawler.py`,
`marker/config/parser.py`, and `marker/output.py` changed. The change
removes the imports of the removed modules, the LLM processors in the
default processor lists, the LLM service of the converter, the
`--llm_service` option, and the extraction output.

2026-10-18: removed from `marker/`: the providers other than
`providers/pdf.py` and `providers/utils.py` (document, epub, html, image,
powerpoint, spreadsheet, and the registry), `converters/ocr.py`,
`converters/table.py`, the renderers `chunk.py`, `json.py`, and
`ocr_json.py`, `processors/util.py`, `utils/batch.py`, and `utils/gpu.py`.
Removed from `surya/`: `scripts/`, `debug/`, `models.py`, `input/load.py`,
and `recognition/languages.py`. Removed from `pdftext/`: `scripts/`. These
parts serve other input formats, other output formats, and the
command-line and browser applications, and raw2md does not call them.

2026-10-18: `marker/converters/pdf.py`, `marker/config/parser.py`, and
`marker/output.py` changed. The change builds the PDF provider directly,
keeps only the Markdown renderer and output format, and removes the
unused output helpers.
